<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Detailed Error Bound Derivation</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide the detailed proofs for the two key approximations that underpin the LongFlow method, justifying the claims made in Section <a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3 Theoretical Justification of the Approximations ‣ 3 Method ‣ LongFlow: Efficient KV Cache Compression for Reasoning Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a>. Our goal is to bound the total error <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}^{i}=\left|\left\|\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{c}_{t}^{i}\right\|^{2}\right|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}^{i}=\left|\left\|\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{c}_{t}^{i}\right\|^{2}\right|</annotation></semantics></math>, which we decompose using the triangle inequality:</p>
<table id="A1.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center">
<div id="A1.E11.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_markedasmath ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:25.1pt;vertical-align:-12.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(59.3pt,-4.3pt) scale(1.52366627345021,1.52366627345021) ;">
<p id="A1.E11.2.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A1.E11.m1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}^{i}\leq\underbrace{\left|\left\|\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\right\|^{2}\right|}_{\text{Error from Denominator Approx.}}+\underbrace{\left|\left\|\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{c}_{t}^{i}\right\|^{2}\right|}_{\text{Error from Query Drift}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Error from Denominator Approx.</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Error from Query Drift</mtext></munder></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}^{i}\leq\underbrace{\left|\left\|\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\right\|^{2}\right|}_{\text{Error from Denominator Approx.}}+\underbrace{\left|\left\|\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{c}_{t}^{i}\right\|^{2}\right|}_{\text{Error from Query Drift}}.</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</span></div></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="0" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">We now derive explicit bounds for each of these two error terms.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Bounding the Error from the Denominator Approximation</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This error arises from approximating the true change in attention output, <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{o}_{t+1}=\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{o}_{t+1}=\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}</annotation></semantics></math>, with the contribution vector <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}=\alpha_{t+1}^{i}\mathbf{v}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}=\alpha_{t+1}^{i}\mathbf{v}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. We now derive an exact expression for the remainder term <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}=\Delta\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}=\Delta\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">First, let us expand the terms. The original attention output is a sum over all <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> historical tokens, while the output after eviction is a sum over the remaining <math id="A1.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t-1</annotation></semantics></math> tokens with re-normalized attention weights:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{j=1}^{t}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}=\alpha_{t+1}^{i}\mathbf{v}^{i}+\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{j=1}^{t}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}=\alpha_{t+1}^{i}\mathbf{v}^{i}+\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}\mathbf{v}^{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}\mathbf{v}^{j}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">Substituting these into the definition of the remainder term:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\Delta\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\Delta\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex4"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left(\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}\right)-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left(\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{o}_{t+1}^{(\setminus i)}\right)-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\biggl(\alpha_{t+1}^{i}\mathbf{v}^{i}+\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}\biggr)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\biggl(\alpha_{t+1}^{i}\mathbf{v}^{i}+\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}\biggr)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\quad-\biggl(\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}\mathbf{v}^{j}\biggr)-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}\mathbf{v}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="2.100em" minsize="2.100em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\quad-\biggl(\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}\mathbf{v}^{j}\biggr)-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}\mathbf{v}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{j\neq i}\left(\alpha_{t+1}^{j}-\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}\right)\mathbf{v}^{j}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{j\neq i}\left(\alpha_{t+1}^{j}-\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}\right)\mathbf{v}^{j}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The key is to relate the new weights <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}</annotation></semantics></math> to the old weights <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t+1}^{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t+1}^{j}</annotation></semantics></math>. The new weights are re-normalized over a smaller set of tokens:</p>
<table id="A1.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}&amp;=\frac{\exp(s_{t+1}^{j})}{\sum_{l\neq i}\exp(s_{t+1}^{l})}\\
&amp;=\frac{\exp(s_{t+1}^{j})}{Z_{t+1}-\exp(s_{t+1}^{i})}\\
&amp;=\frac{\exp(s_{t+1}^{j})/Z_{t+1}}{(Z_{t+1}-\exp(s_{t+1}^{i}))/Z_{t+1}}\\
&amp;=\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{j}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∖</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}\alpha_{t+1}^{j,(\setminus i)}&amp;=\frac{\exp(s_{t+1}^{j})}{\sum_{l\neq i}\exp(s_{t+1}^{l})}\\
&amp;=\frac{\exp(s_{t+1}^{j})}{Z_{t+1}-\exp(s_{t+1}^{i})}\\
&amp;=\frac{\exp(s_{t+1}^{j})/Z_{t+1}}{(Z_{t+1}-\exp(s_{t+1}^{i}))/Z_{t+1}}\\
&amp;=\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{j}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Now, we substitute this identity back into the expression for the remainder term:</p>
<table id="A1.E13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}&amp;=\sum_{j\neq i}\left(\alpha_{t+1}^{j}-\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{j}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\right)\mathbf{v}^{j}\\
&amp;=\sum_{j\neq i}\left(\frac{-\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\right)\mathbf{v}^{j}\\
&amp;=-\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><msubsup><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mi>α</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msup><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}&amp;=\sum_{j\neq i}\left(\alpha_{t+1}^{j}-\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{j}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\right)\mathbf{v}^{j}\\
&amp;=\sum_{j\neq i}\left(\frac{-\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\right)\mathbf{v}^{j}\\
&amp;=-\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p4.2" class="ltx_p">Finally, we recognize that the remaining summation is simply the original attention output minus the contribution of the <math id="A1.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>-th token: <math id="A1.SS1.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}=\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j\neq i}\alpha_{t+1}^{j}\mathbf{v}^{j}=\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. This gives the final exact expression for the remainder term:</p>
<table id="A1.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}=-\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\left(\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\right)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}=-\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\left(\mathbf{o}_{t+1}-\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS1.p4.3" class="ltx_p">Taking the norm and assuming <math id="A1.SS1.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mathbf{v}^{j}\|\leq V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mathbf{v}^{j}\|\leq V</annotation></semantics></math>, we have <math id="A1.SS1.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mathbf{o}_{t+1}\|\leq V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mathbf{o}_{t+1}\|\leq V</annotation></semantics></math>. The norm of the remainder is then bounded:</p>
<table id="A1.E15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\begin{split}\|\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}\|&amp;\leq\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\left(\|\mathbf{o}_{t+1}\|+\|\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\|\right)\\
&amp;\leq\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{i}(1+\alpha_{t+1}^{i})}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}V\\
&amp;\leq\frac{2V\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}.\end{split}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mtable columnspacing="0pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_right" columnalign="right"><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐑</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐨</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{split}\|\mathbf{R}_{t+1}^{i}\|&amp;\leq\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}\left(\|\mathbf{o}_{t+1}\|+\|\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\|\right)\\
&amp;\leq\frac{\alpha_{t+1}^{i}(1+\alpha_{t+1}^{i})}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}V\\
&amp;\leq\frac{2V\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}{1-\alpha_{t+1}^{i}}.\end{split}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Bounding the Error from the Query Approximation</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This error arises from query drift, captured by the term <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left|\|\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\|^{2}-\|\mathbf{c}_{t}^{i}\|^{2}\right|=\left|(\alpha_{t+1}^{i})^{2}-(\alpha_{t}^{i})^{2}\right|\cdot\|\mathbf{v}^{i}\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐜</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">|</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left|\|\mathbf{c}_{t+1}^{i}\|^{2}-\|\mathbf{c}_{t}^{i}\|^{2}\right|=\left|(\alpha_{t+1}^{i})^{2}-(\alpha_{t}^{i})^{2}\right|\cdot\|\mathbf{v}^{i}\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math>. The core task is to bound <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\alpha_{t+1}^{i}-\alpha_{t}^{i}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\alpha_{t+1}^{i}-\alpha_{t}^{i}|</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 1</span></span><span id="Thmlemma1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Lipschitz Property of Softmax)<span id="Thmlemma1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The softmax function <math id="Thmlemma1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma(\mathbf{s})_{i}=\exp(s^{i})/\sum_{j}\exp(s^{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">/</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma(\mathbf{s})_{i}=\exp(s^{i})/\sum_{j}\exp(s^{j})</annotation></semantics></math> is 1-Lipschitz continuous with respect to the L1-norm on its output and the L-infinity norm on its input.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">By the Mean Value Theorem for vector-valued functions, for any two score vectors <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{s}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{s}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{s}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>, there exists a point <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐜</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{c}</annotation></semantics></math> on the line segment between them such that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma(\mathbf{s}^{\prime})-\sigma(\mathbf{s})=J_{\sigma}(\mathbf{c})(\mathbf{s}^{\prime}-\mathbf{s})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>σ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐜</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐬</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma(\mathbf{s}^{\prime})-\sigma(\mathbf{s})=J_{\sigma}(\mathbf{c})(\mathbf{s}^{\prime}-\mathbf{s})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{\sigma}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>σ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math> is the Jacobian matrix of the softmax function. Our goal is to bound the norm of this Jacobian. The entries of the Jacobian, <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{ij}=\frac{\partial\sigma_{i}}{\partial s^{j}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{ij}=\frac{\partial\sigma_{i}}{\partial s^{j}}</annotation></semantics></math>, are computed as follows:</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">For the diagonal entries (<math id="A1.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=j</annotation></semantics></math>):</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx3" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial\sigma_{i}}{\partial s^{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial\sigma_{i}}{\partial s^{i}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\partial}{\partial s^{i}}\left(\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\partial}{\partial s^{i}}\left(\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\exp(s^{i})\left(\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})\right)-\exp(s^{i})\exp(s^{i})}{(\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k}))^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\exp(s^{i})\left(\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})\right)-\exp(s^{i})\exp(s^{i})}{(\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k}))^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\left(1-\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\left(1-\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma_{i}(1-\sigma_{i})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma_{i}(1-\sigma_{i}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text">For the off-diagonal entries (<math id="A1.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\neq j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\neq j</annotation></semantics></math>):</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{\partial\sigma_{i}}{\partial s^{j}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{\partial\sigma_{i}}{\partial s^{j}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\partial}{\partial s^{j}}\left(\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mo>∂</mo><mrow><mo>∂</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\partial}{\partial s^{j}}\left(\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{0-\exp(s^{i})\exp(s^{j})}{(\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k}))^{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mo lspace="0em">∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{0-\exp(s^{i})\exp(s^{j})}{(\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k}))^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\frac{\exp(s^{j})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\frac{\exp(s^{i})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}\frac{\exp(s^{j})}{\sum_{k}\exp(s^{k})}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\sigma_{i}\sigma_{j}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\sigma_{i}\sigma_{j}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text">Thus, the Jacobian can be succinctly written as <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{ij}=\sigma_{i}(\delta_{ij}-\sigma_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{ij}=\sigma_{i}(\delta_{ij}-\sigma_{j})</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{ij}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math> is the Kronecker delta.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text">To obtain the bound used in the main text, we need to bound the induced L1/L<math id="A1.SS2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\infty</annotation></semantics></math> norm. It is a known property of the softmax function that <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\sigma(\mathbf{s}^{\prime})-\sigma(\mathbf{s})\|_{1}\leq\|\mathbf{s}^{\prime}-\mathbf{s}\|_{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐬</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐬</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐬</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\sigma(\mathbf{s}^{\prime})-\sigma(\mathbf{s})\|_{1}\leq\|\mathbf{s}^{\prime}-\mathbf{s}\|_{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math>, which means the Lipschitz constant for this norm pairing is 1. While the full proof of this specific norm bound is lengthy and typically presented in optimization literature, we can gain insight by analyzing the simpler induced L1-norm, <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|J\|_{1}=\max_{j}\sum_{i}|J_{ij}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mmultiscripts><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi><mrow></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mi>j</mi><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em">⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|J\|_{1}=\max_{j}\sum_{i}|J_{ij}|</annotation></semantics></math>. The sum of the absolute values of the <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>-th column is:</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{i}|J_{ij}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{i}|J_{ij}|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=|\sigma_{j}(1-\sigma_{j})|+\sum_{i\neq j}|-\sigma_{i}\sigma_{j}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=|\sigma_{j}(1-\sigma_{j})|+\sum_{i\neq j}|-\sigma_{i}\sigma_{j}|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma_{j}(1-\sigma_{j})+\sum_{i\neq j}\sigma_{i}\sigma_{j}\quad(\text{since }\sigma_{k}\in[0,1])" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>since </mtext><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma_{j}(1-\sigma_{j})+\sum_{i\neq j}\sigma_{i}\sigma_{j}\quad(\text{since }\sigma_{k}\in[0,1])</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma_{j}-\sigma_{j}^{2}+\sigma_{j}\sum_{i\neq j}\sigma_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma_{j}-\sigma_{j}^{2}+\sigma_{j}\sum_{i\neq j}\sigma_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma_{j}-\sigma_{j}^{2}+\sigma_{j}(1-\sigma_{j})=2\sigma_{j}(1-\sigma_{j})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma_{j}-\sigma_{j}^{2}+\sigma_{j}(1-\sigma_{j})=2\sigma_{j}(1-\sigma_{j}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.2.1" class="ltx_text">Since the maximum value of the function <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(x)=2x(1-x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(x)=2x(1-x)</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in[0,1]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math> is <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1/2</annotation></semantics></math> (at <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x=1/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x=1/2</annotation></semantics></math>), the induced L1-norm is bounded by <math id="A1.SS2.p4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|J\|_{1}\leq 1/2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|J\|_{1}\leq 1/2</annotation></semantics></math>. The bound of 1 for the L1/<math id="A1.SS2.p4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L^{\infty}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L^{\infty}</annotation></semantics></math> norm pairing used in our main analysis is a tighter, more specific result.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Applying the Lemma, the change in a single attention weight is bounded by the maximum change in any pre-softmax score:</p>
<table id="A1.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\alpha_{t+1}^{i}-\alpha_{t}^{i}|\leq\max_{j}|s_{t+1}^{j}-s_{t}^{j}|." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mi>j</mi></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\alpha_{t+1}^{i}-\alpha_{t}^{i}|\leq\max_{j}|s_{t+1}^{j}-s_{t}^{j}|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p5.2" class="ltx_p">The error in the scores, <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{t+1}^{j}-s_{t}^{j}=(\mathbf{q}_{t+1}-\mathbf{q}_{t})^{T}\mathbf{k}^{j}/\sqrt{d_{k}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐤</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow><mo>/</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{t+1}^{j}-s_{t}^{j}=(\mathbf{q}_{t+1}-\mathbf{q}_{t})^{T}\mathbf{k}^{j}/\sqrt{d_{k}}</annotation></semantics></math>, is bounded by the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality. Assuming unit-normalized queries, we have <math id="A1.SS2.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mathbf{q}_{t+1}-\mathbf{q}_{t}\|^{2}=2(1-\text{cos}(\mathbf{q}_{t},\mathbf{q}_{t+1}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mtext>cos</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mathbf{q}_{t+1}-\mathbf{q}_{t}\|^{2}=2(1-\text{cos}(\mathbf{q}_{t},\mathbf{q}_{t+1}))</annotation></semantics></math>. This gives the final bound on the maximum score error:</p>
<table id="A1.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max_{j}|\Delta s^{j}|\leq\frac{\sqrt{2(1-\text{cos}(\mathbf{q}_{t},\mathbf{q}_{t+1}))}\cdot\max_{j}\|\mathbf{k}^{j}\|}{\sqrt{d_{k}}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mi>j</mi></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mtext>cos</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐪</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msup><mi>𝐤</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max_{j}|\Delta s^{j}|\leq\frac{\sqrt{2(1-\text{cos}(\mathbf{q}_{t},\mathbf{q}_{t+1}))}\cdot\max_{j}\|\mathbf{k}^{j}\|}{\sqrt{d_{k}}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Combined Error Bound</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">By combining the bounds for both error sources, we can conclude that the total error <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is small when our method evicts a token with a small attention weight <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{t+1}^{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{t+1}^{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and when the query similarity is high. This provides a rigorous theoretical foundation for the effectiveness of the LongFlow method.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Algorithm of LongFlow Kernel</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix B Algorithm of LongFlow Kernel ‣ LongFlow: Efficient KV Cache Compression for Reasoning Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> shows the workflow of our kernel.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> LongFlow Fused Attention and Eviction Kernel</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
